WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.480
Hello, hello, hello!

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:07.790
You’re watching SCP Explained, and today,
we’ve got an offer you simply can’t refuse:

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:13.030
The very latest in anomalous self-improvement
technology, which the SCP Foundation calls

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:18.410
SCP-212, but we much prefer to call The Improver.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.210
Believe us when we say that this miraculous
device will change your life.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.839
You’ll never be the same after a run-in
with The Improver.

00:00:24.839 --> 00:00:28.259
It’ll make you fitter, healthier, better.

00:00:28.259 --> 00:00:29.259
Not convinced?

00:00:29.259 --> 00:00:32.930
Don’t worry - just sit back, and let us
sell you the dream!

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.260
Here’s some unpleasant news: You’re going
to die!

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:40.040
No matter how healthy you are right now, there
will inevitably come a day when your lungs

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.010
stop pumping, your ticker stops ticking, and
all those delightful little synapses in your

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.330
brain stop sending electrical and chemical
signals to and fro.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.330
What a bummer!

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:50.480
Why would you want to be dead?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.970
You can’t do stuff when you’re dead!

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:55.960
And it’s all because everyone is eventually
betrayed by the very things currently keeping

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:59.760
them alive: Those pesky, squishy, fallible
organs.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:04.080
But thanks to The Improver, getting stuck
with the organs you were born with is a problem

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.080
of yesteryear.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.979
No matter what those lousy Sarkicists tell
you, the flesh is unreliable.

00:01:09.979 --> 00:01:11.400
Metal and plastic, on the other hand?

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.909
That’s built to last.

00:01:12.909 --> 00:01:18.189
Bleeding hearts talk a lot about “Quality
of life”, but what really matters is “Quantity

00:01:18.189 --> 00:01:22.119
of Life”, and if you’re strong enough,
that’s what The Improver - a state-of-the-art

00:01:22.119 --> 00:01:24.630
piece of medical technology - will give you.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.680
Don’t look so afraid.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.500
You replace your phone every year.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.340
You replace your laptop every few years.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:34.039
So why get all sentimental about needing to
trade in your old liver, eyes, limbs, or skin

00:01:34.039 --> 00:01:35.039
for the new model?

00:01:35.039 --> 00:01:40.530
Or, in the words of another great businessman,
“Why be you when you can be new?”

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:41.969
Not convinced?

00:01:41.969 --> 00:01:45.350
Let us tell you about the incredible features
that The Improver has to offer.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:49.499
I’m talking three, top of the line fully
opposable, plastic and steel autonomous medical

00:01:49.499 --> 00:01:53.930
limbs - that’s industry lingo for robot
arms that work on their own - with five hundred,

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:57.180
count ‘em, five hundred different attachments!

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.289
But I know what you’re thinking, “Five
hundred attachments?

00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:02.740
Where am I gonna find the room for all that,
SCP Explained?”

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.779
To which we say, don’t worry about it!

00:02:04.779 --> 00:02:08.740
Due to its spatially anomalous properties,
The Improver is able to store all these attachments

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:12.810
within its arms without any additional space
concerns.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:15.099
And hey, I see that nervous look in your eye.

00:02:15.099 --> 00:02:17.580
You’re worried about the operating costs,
right?

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.860
But don’t worry, there’s no need!

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.690
The Improver is completely self-powered, with
no discernable power source.

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:28.120
And you know this thing is safe because the
SCP Foundation has given it the “Safe”

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.120
object class.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:32.550
Sure, that doesn’t technically mean it’s
not dangerous, but it does mean it won’t

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:36.760
sprout legs and walk off if you leave it to
its own devices, so you’re looking at a

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.480
long-term investment with a three-year warranty,
and an endorsement from the fabulous folks

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.780
at the Church of the Broken God.

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.489
You just can’t argue with these deals, my
friends!

00:02:46.489 --> 00:02:49.650
We even offer competitive rates against Marshall,
Carter, and Dark!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.360
But hey, we’re not trying to pull the wool
over your eyes here.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.260
You’re a smart consumer.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.709
We know that you know that the actual financial
cost is only one layer of the overall cost:

00:02:58.709 --> 00:03:01.690
Time and training is also, of course, a factor.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:08.349
But we’ve got some good news for you, sunshine
- The Improver is 100% user-friendly.

00:03:08.349 --> 00:03:09.940
No setup, no mess, no problem.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:15.370
No trying to interpret poorly written instructions
or watching padded-out YouTube tech tutorials

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:19.231
where the guy just will not get to the point,
The Improver operates itself.

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:23.670
It may be a piece of hyper-advanced anomalous
technology, but it’s easier to use than

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:27.239
most wireless printers!

00:03:27.239 --> 00:03:32.290
The steps to using The Improver are so simple,
a monkey could do it: Just step within a 1.5-meter

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:34.989
range of the machine, and it will do the rest.

00:03:34.989 --> 00:03:39.160
You’ll feel your troubles melt away as the
powerful mechanical arms grab you and restrain

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.329
you against the floor.

00:03:40.329 --> 00:03:44.750
You’ll be subjected to a brief, relaxing
scan, where The Improver will determine exactly

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.340
what needs to be changed about your fragile
human physiology.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.640
And then, before you know it, surgery will
commence!

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.319
Warning: SCP Explained is not liable for any
excruciating pain caused by The Improver.

00:03:54.319 --> 00:03:55.829
Medical sedatives and anesthetics are sold
separately.

00:03:55.829 --> 00:03:58.110
The consumer is responsible for their own
pain relief when using The Improver.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.849
Second Warning: The consumer is also responsible
for their own blood transfusions when using

00:04:00.849 --> 00:04:01.849
The Improver.

00:04:01.849 --> 00:04:03.989
Neither The Improver nor SCP Explained is
liable for any blood lost while using The

00:04:03.989 --> 00:04:04.989
Improver.

00:04:04.989 --> 00:04:05.989
Your blood, your problem.

00:04:05.989 --> 00:04:08.860
Now with those tiny little caveats out of
the way, we can carry on telling you just

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.060
how fantastic The Improver is.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.790
Sure, flesh-worshipping Sarkicist losers and
haters will tell you that it has a mortality

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:19.570
rate of around 47%, but we prefer to look
on the bright side and focus on its excellent

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.799
53% survival rate.

00:04:21.799 --> 00:04:25.770
Rest assured, the odds are still very much
in your favor when you use The Improver.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:29.320
And doesn’t adding a slight risk to the
equation just make the whole process even

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.320
more exciting?

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:31.930
We certainly think it does!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:36.169
And in the reasonably likely event that you
survive using The Improver, the benefits will

00:04:36.169 --> 00:04:37.620
vastly outweigh the costs!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:42.190
It can do incredible things - like lining
your joints with graphite, replacing your

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:47.740
nasty flesh organs with more powerful artificial
ones, adding new or duplicate organs, replacing

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:52.620
those unreliable teeth with serrated steel
bands, and so much more!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:56.259
Is there anything this absolute marvel of
a machine can’t do?

00:04:56.259 --> 00:05:00.539
Doctors hate it - The Improver is here to
fix every aspect of your life and health with

00:05:00.539 --> 00:05:02.830
its simple anomalous tricks.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:07.180
It even has a special sealant for wound-closing
that no medical professional on earth has

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:08.180
access to.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.180
What is it, exactly?

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:12.440
Well, if we told you, I’m afraid we’d
have to kill you.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.090
It’s a trade secret!

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:19.449
You’d have to be crazy to not want The Improver
in your home, but if, for some crazy reason,

00:05:19.449 --> 00:05:23.509
you still need to be convinced, let’s look
at some real success stories of The Improver

00:05:23.509 --> 00:05:28.680
in action - straight from SCP Foundation testing
logs!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:32.960
Listen close and soon you’ll see, The Improver
literally makes satisfied customers!

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:38.090
The Foundation put a 28-year-old African-American
Agent into The Improver of his own volition.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:43.410
It replaced his boring lower jawbone with
a super-dense ceramic jaw, with ceramic blades

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.810
instead of teeth.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:49.050
It also removed his spine and replaced it
with a synthetic polymer, which was easily

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.180
affixed to the base of his skull.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.800
And at no extra charge, it even coated his
rib cage and pelvis with a thin layer of ceramic,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:59.560
before removing his lungs, eyes, and liver
for cleaning and replacement.

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.480
That’s right, cleaning!

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.270
The Improver can remove organs and, through
a patented cleaning process, remove genetic

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:10.849
defects and allow them to appear younger and
healthier than generic, Brand-X Organs.

00:06:10.849 --> 00:06:14.819
This agent has since returned to active duty,
and is even better at his job, all thanks

00:06:14.819 --> 00:06:16.710
to The Improver!

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:21.960
A 42-year-old British Foundation researcher
was submitted for testing on The Improver.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:27.060
It replaced his teeth with sleek, super-dense
ceramic, reinstated his inefficient feet,

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:30.862
and replaced them with a complex latticework,
covered in sticky pads that would have let

00:06:30.862 --> 00:06:36.250
him climb on any surface and hold up to 225kg
of weight.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.730
It also took out and cleaned a huge number
of his organs, removed his bone marrow and

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:44.639
replaced it with blue synthetic gel - much
more effective, we assure you - and inserted

00:06:44.639 --> 00:06:48.050
a few random bits of metal into his brain
at no extra cost.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:53.010
Sadly, this researcher passed away during
the bone marrow removal process, but for all

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.629
we know, that could easily just be a coincidence.

00:06:55.629 --> 00:07:00.810
Next came an Agent codenamed “A.A.”, who
had suffered a pretty severe accident at work,

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.900
losing all of his limbs, one of his eyes,
a few of his organs, and suffering a pretty

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.849
traumatic head injury - namely, taking a piece
of circuit board to the brain during an explosion.

00:07:08.849 --> 00:07:12.600
He was given over to The Improver, seeing
as he didn’t really have much to lose in

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.800
terms of physical integrity.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:18.699
But seeing that it’s an amazing piece of
groundbreaking technology, The Improver never

00:07:18.699 --> 00:07:20.990
takes the obvious option.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:25.840
It gave A.A. a chemical that forced him into
a coma, and then properly integrated the circuit

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.440
board into his brain
It continues to spread and assimilate more

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.289
of his brain matter while he’s in a comatose
state.

00:07:32.289 --> 00:07:36.520
But when he awakens with a much more efficient
brain, he’ll probably be incredibly grateful

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.879
to The Improver for helping him like this.

00:07:38.879 --> 00:07:43.370
And it’s not just people with severe injuries
that The Improver can lend three helping robotic

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:48.360
hands to, it’s also the victims of severe,
and even anomalous, diseases.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:53.930
Take victims of SCP-217, a rather horrific
and painful disease that mechanizes the entire

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:58.040
body, until the sufferers aren’t really
themselves anymore.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.330
A normal, uninspired SCP Foundation researcher
may look at someone like this and see a lost

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.580
cause, but with the help of The Improver,
no cause is lost!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.300
A D-Class in the advanced stages of the disease
was run through the machine, and while the

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:14.930
exact details of what it did to him are another
trade secret, it’s safe to say he was truly

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.640
fighting fit when he came out on the other
side.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:21.449
We mean that literally: He easily escaped
containment and overpowered two heavily armed

00:08:21.449 --> 00:08:25.280
guards, before taking the lives of several
members of Foundation staff before being captured

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:27.789
and terminated sometime later.

00:08:27.789 --> 00:08:30.909
You can’t argue with those incredible results,
folks.

00:08:30.909 --> 00:08:36.419
Next came a 26-year-old SCP Foundation researcher,
who - due to an unfortunate brush with a less

00:08:36.419 --> 00:08:40.469
wonderful and beneficial anomaly - had been
rendered completely blind.

00:08:40.469 --> 00:08:44.380
However, when he was brought into the grasp
of The Improver, it immediately set to work

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.820
on solving the doctor’s little problem.

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:51.470
It removed his two non-functioning eyes and
made the interesting creative choice of widening

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:55.760
the two cavities in his head so they met in
the middle and formed one huge cavity for

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.410
a single large sensory organ.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:02.600
This cavity was then filled with large metal
spikes resembling hair, which are far more

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.269
interesting than typical eyes.

00:09:05.269 --> 00:09:09.190
During The Improver’s delicate medical procedures,
the scientist inexplicably entered a state

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:13.959
of visible distress, and began repeating the
phrase, “It tastes all wrong.”

00:09:13.959 --> 00:09:18.649
At this point, the metal cilia in the scientist’s
single large eye cavity began to grow, extending

00:09:18.649 --> 00:09:22.530
up through the roof of the cavity and into
the subject’s brain, killing him.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:26.589
We want to specify that SCP Explained and
The Improver are in no way responsible for

00:09:26.589 --> 00:09:27.970
this unfortunate incident.

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:32.360
It’s entirely the researcher’s fault for
setting off his own metal eye cavity cilia.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:36.290
Before we bring this anomalous infomercial
to an end - and of course, before you immediately

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:41.070
grab your credit card to buy your own Improver
device - we want to sneak a few more disclaimers

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.070
under the wire.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:44.529
For starters, The Improver doesn’t work
on animals.

00:09:44.529 --> 00:09:48.300
When a rat was used as a test subject, the
device attempted to modify the rat into a

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:53.330
bipedal being, removing the majority of its
organs and replacing it with white paste.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:57.149
So if your pet rat gets sick, just take it
to the vet instead.

00:09:57.149 --> 00:09:59.460
The Improver also doesn’t work on corpses.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:05.270
It may be a miraculous piece of technology,
but it’s not a literal miracle worker.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.760
One freshly executed D-Class was presented
to The Improver, and instead of operating

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:12.639
on him, The Improver cut open his stomach
and instead began constructing something out

00:10:12.639 --> 00:10:16.690
of the meal he had consumed the night prior
to his death: A seafood dinner.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:21.350
The broken crustacean parts were then constructed
into a bioluminescent lobster-like creature.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.140
So if you’re planning on bringing someone
back from the dead, we’re afraid you’re

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.779
going to need to take up necromancy instead.

00:10:26.779 --> 00:10:30.670
But if you haven’t died yet, and you’re
looking to improve yourself, then you cannot

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:33.020
invest in a better product than The Improver.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.300
The one problem is that the only known prototype
of The Improver is currently locked in an

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:41.490
SCP Foundation containment site, so getting
your hands on these three special arms may

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.040
cost you your life.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.040
What?

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:46.060
Who said attaining perfection would be easy?

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:52.270
Now go check out “SCP-914 - The Clockworks”
and “SCP-001 - The Broken God - Ouroboros

00:10:52.270 --> 00:11:00.329
Cycle” for more frightening anomalous machines!

